Dialogue: 10,0:00:04.12,0:00:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like Nadeshiko is continuing to wear me down.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:08.34,0:00:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But having a relationship with a sex bot is just...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:15.43,0:00:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But hey,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:16.74,0:00:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}having someone to welcome me home is pretty nice.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:19.91,0:00:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm home!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:23.54,0:00:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome home, Akane!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:26.02,0:00:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I take it back!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:28.15,0:00:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you like dinner?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:29.62,0:00:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you like a bath?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:31.23,0:00:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Or would you like {\i1}me{\i0}?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:32.69,0:00:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She's entered the newlywed phase!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:35.35,0:00:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, enough of that already.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:39.28,0:00:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with all this super-fancy food?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:41.30,0:00:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I made it all for you.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:43.48,0:00:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You have cooking functions, too?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:45.32,0:00:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:46.65,0:00:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,My base programming is only for communication,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:50.11,0:00:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,but I can synthesize new data to tackle other tasks.{sgt: something something machine learning}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:55.90,0:00:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but that's still...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:01.49,0:01:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what'll you have first?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:04.20,0:01:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You can also eat me out, if you—
Dialogue: 10,0:01:06.25,0:01:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm eating dinner, bathing, then going to bed!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:10.76,0:01:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't had a warm bath in months.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:13.87,0:01:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1\q2}Nadeshiko demonstrated \Nthat she can act outside of her programming.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:17.89,0:01:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She can think and learn just like a human.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:21.33,0:01:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Akane? Is the temperature to your liking?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:23.84,0:01:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Nadeshiko?!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:25.09,0:01:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I asked you, remember? \NAfter your dinner and bath, it's my turn.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:28.28,0:01:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, no, that's quite all right.{orig: No, that's quite all right.}{sgt: I really just want to rewrite this to be something else entirely but idk if that's a good idea.}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:33.35,0:01:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-Why's everything so slippery?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:35.82,0:01:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I added bath salts{additive} that contain a lubricating agent.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:41.63,0:01:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1\q2}It's been so long since I've had a bath \Nthat I didn't even notice!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:45.15,0:01:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! Time out!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:47.28,0:01:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, of course.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:49.33,0:01:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll overheat if you stay in the bath for too long.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:52.54,0:01:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,There are other ways to have fun in here.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:55.80,0:01:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,For example, like this.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:58.12,0:02:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is your angle, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:00.80,0:02:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Angle? What do you mean?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:03.78,0:02:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1\q2}Our lubed bodies feel so good \Npressed up against each other.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:08.69,0:02:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But it's kinda weird...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:13.20,0:02:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's like my arousal is welling up deep inside me!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:16.66,0:02:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you're so much more turned on than usual.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:21.31,0:02:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be the softshell turtle you had for dinner.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:25.21,0:02:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is delicious.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:27.08,0:02:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that how badly you want to have sex with me?!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:30.55,0:02:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed. After all,
Dialogue: 10,0:02:33.14,0:02:35.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you so very much, Akane.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:36.52,0:02:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1\q2}She loves me? That's gotta be \Nher programming talking, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:40.94,0:02:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What about you, Akane?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:43.64,0:02:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you love me back?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:46.52,0:02:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:53.08,0:02:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Akane?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:54.68,0:02:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:57.93,0:03:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm too horny to think straight.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:01.72,0:03:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:02.79,0:03:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry! My hands had completely stopped.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:13.55,0:03:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1\q2}I can't believe she had me making \Nthose sounds nonstop last night.{orig: And what's worse is how she got me to make those sounds over and over again.}{sgt: no idea why the original begins with "And what's worse". It feels like we've skipped over something. I took some liberties here in an attempt to make it make sense.}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:20.61,0:03:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, an email.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:22.88,0:03:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:24.52,0:03:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1\q2}An online meetup exclusively \Nfor sex android owners?
